6. APPLICATIONS

The extended architecture makes certified agency possible in domains where stochastic agency is currently disqualified.

Domain Norm What Certification Requires What ST-T1024+Agency Provides
Automotive ISO 26262 (ASIL-D) Certified decision-to-act Bounded decisions, enumerated action set, VERIFY gate
Industrial IEC 61508 (SIL 3) Certified autonomous sequences ROM-burned plans, tile invocation protocol
Aerospace DO-178C (DAL A/B) Certified autonomy Verifiable behavior set; redundancy for DAL A
Medical IEC 62304 Certified surgical/clinical action Deterministic action, envelope bounds
Defense Sovereign Autonomous systems not controllable by foreign APIs Air-gapped, SK-1024, no external control
Grid IEC 62443 Certified switching under attack No network surface; deterministic action surface
Robotics ISO 10218 / ISO/TS 15066 Certified motion safety Motion envelopes, abort conditions, no free-form planning

In every case, the enabling property is the same: the behavior set is finite and provable.

6.1 The Automobile

Today's ASIL-D certified systems are not agentic. They are hard-wired decision trees with tightly bounded action spaces. ST-T1024+Agency generalizes this. It offers the same discipline — bounded behavior, enumerated actions, formal verification — with the flexibility of a plan library and a triage engine.

The agent does not "decide" in an unbounded sense. It selects from a proven plan and verifies the action before executing. The result is autonomy that is certifiable rather than merely tested.

6.2 The Industrial Robot

SIL 3 does not mean "the robot almost never crushes the worker." It means "we can prove, in advance, that the robot cannot crush the worker within its declared envelope." ST-T1024+Agency provides the architectural substrate for that proof.

6.3 The Defense System

A sovereign nation cannot field an autonomous system that depends on a foreign API, because the API can be cut, spoofed, or weaponized. ST-T1024+Agency provides an autonomous system that is air-gappable, auditable, and sovereign by construction. It cannot be turned against its operator by a third party, because there is no third party in the loop.

